1. Windows names and values (windows-sys)

   The names and values of the Windows keyboard-layout structures, fields and constants used
   in this repository (KBDTABLES, VK_TO_WCHAR_TABLE, DEADKEY, LIGATURE, KLLF_ALTGR,
   KLLF_SHIFTLOCK, KLLF_LRM_RLM, KBDSHIFT, KBDCTRL, KBDALT, KBDKANA, KBDROYA, KBDLOYA,
   KBDGRPSELTAP, CAPLOK, SGCAPS, CAPLOKALTGR, KANALOK, GRPSELTAP, WCH_NONE, WCH_DEAD, WCH_LGTR,
   DKF_DEAD, SHFT_INVALID, KBD_VERSION, the KBDNLS_* and NLSKBD_* constants, the VK_* virtual-key
   names and others) are taken from the `windows-sys` crate, version 0.61.2, module
   Win32::UI::Input::KeyboardAndMouse:

       https://crates.io/crates/windows-sys/0.61.2
       https://github.com/microsoft/windows-rs

   windows-sys is licensed under MIT OR Apache-2.0. Its copyright line:

       Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation.

   They reach this repository through the clean YAKBD specification set, revision 10, which
   records the same source in its NOTICE. Only names and values are used.

   The YAKBD specification set itself (revision 10) was relicensed by its owner to MIT-0 for use
   in the yakbd repositories (2026-11-22); text taken from it is cited by section.

   targets/windows-vk-names.tsv is a copy of the reference specification's
   spec/klc-format/tables/vk-names.tsv (revision 10), generated there from the VK_* constants of
   windows-sys 0.61.2; only names and values.

2. Scan-code flag names (FreeRDP)

   Eight scan-code flag names (KBDEXT, KBDMULTIVK, KBDSPECIAL, KBDNUMPAD, KBDUNICODE,
   KBDINJECTEDVK, KBDMAPPEDVK, KBDBREAK) and their values (0x0100 to 0x8000) are taken from
   FreeRDP's WinPR header winpr/include/winpr/input.h, lines 30 to 37 at commit
   eb104c8689fec09bf94c6baac46fb585c3aa906f:

       https://github.com/FreeRDP/FreeRDP/blob/eb104c8689fec09bf94c6baac46fb585c3aa906f/winpr/include/winpr/input.h#L30-L37

   FreeRDP is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The copyright line of that file:

       Copyright 2012 Marc-Andre Moreau <marcandre.moreau@gmail.com>

   Only the eight names and their values are used; no other text of that file.

